<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this macro removes pretty mutch all of the mpx recoil
in game settings:
fov 84
1920x1080
sens 6
dpi 800
1x 40

mpx build :
compensator holo vertical grip

if the macro isn't pulling hard enough lower the delays
if the macro is pulling too hard make the delays higher
if it still isnt acurate try changing the mouse values but make sure to change 1x/y at a time for optimal testing</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
